	(text "Front end: F1 (250 VDC interrupt) -> D1 S3M reverse block -> D2 SMDJ100A 3kW -> R80 1R 2512 anti-surge (F-15 approved) -> buck. Margin at 3.7A clamp: 34.9%. R80 at the 10.5V floor, full load: V_B=9.16V, I=0.644A, 0.41W. 10R was a brown-out (no load-line solution) - see design-log F-15."
